- Extend the script to also copy paragraph/character/object styles, swatches, and basic preferences.
- Instead of duplicating page items, force overrides of master items onto pages (if you prefer master items to be copied onto pages rather than referenced).
- Handle anchored objects and threaded text frames with preservation of story continuity across pages.

Tell me which of those you prefer and I can provide a tailored update.

